{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b910d2f344c968fd","name":"Charging Fire","source":{"id":"source:reference-b910d2f344c968fd","title":"Charging Fire","revision":18027,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:28:02Z","sha256":"307e5c96090a1acec9c60445c43eb1019b5ec56fd2221d15ad793cf68fa9abc5","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18027","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Charging%20Fire&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b910d2f344c968fd","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are able to make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:3c89b302f9fd687b"}," while ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charging"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charging"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"}," +4\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," When you ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charge","referenceId":"reference:ff9f88ce353a2228"},", you may make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," instead of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," at the end of your movement. Unlike a normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charge","referenceId":"reference:ff9f88ce353a2228"},", your momentum does not help you overcome your target, so you gain no bonus on your attack roll. As with a normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charge","referenceId":"reference:ff9f88ce353a2228"},", you still take a -2 penalty to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Normal:"]}," You can make a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," with a +2 bonus on your attack roll at the end of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charge","referenceId":"reference:ff9f88ce353a2228"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Combined Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Combined_Feat"},":"]}," If you have the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dodge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dodge","referenceId":"reference:9444f216899dc20b"}," feat, you reduce your penalty to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," against all opponents to -1 when making a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," at the end of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charge","referenceId":"reference:ff9f88ce353a2228"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
